# Build gate for the danger-sign review.
#
# `npm run build` deliberately FAILS while any entry in
# content/red-flag-labels.ts is marked `reviewed: false`. Those sentences sit at
# the top of every condition page and need a clinician's sign-off, not a
# copywriter's.
#
# Set this to true to deploy a preview before that review lands. Remove it the
# moment the labels are signed off — it is the only thing standing between
# unreviewed clinical copy and a frightened reader.
ALLOW_UNREVIEWED_RED_FLAGS=true
